    "text": "BY virtue of powers vested in me under paragraph 8(b) of section 154(b) of the Constitution of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka, I, Karunaratna Divulgane, Governor of the North Central Province declare hereby that the third sessionof the sixth Provincial Council of the North Central Province came to end on mid - night of November 10th 2014, and",
